        <span itemprop="definition">supplied by Mitsui Chemicals, Inc., Chemipearl WP100, average particle diameter 1  ⁇ m, melting point 148° C.: 37.5 parts by mass (25 parts by mass in terms of solids alone).</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0148">
